      "role": "user",
      "content": "Mr. Vane missed our 9:00 AM session this morning. This is completely unacceptable. We haven't heard a word from his office, and my partners are already questioning whether his firm is actually prepared for this round of funding. Given the scale of the deal on the table, we need a formal explanation for this lapse in communication immediately. What happened?",
